Package: generativeart
Title: Create Generative Art with R
Version: 1.1.0
Authors@R: person("Katharina", "Brunner", email = "mail@katharina-brunner.de", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Create Generative Art with R by generating first the data
    and then plot the data.
    Moreover the used formula, the seeds and all plot parameters are recorded.
    Therefore the images with random numbers can be recreated.
Depends:
    R (>= 3.5.0)
Imports:
    ggplot2,
    purrr,
    dplyr,
    magrittr
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
RoxygenNote: 7.3.1
